                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.28354/2610.28354v1/teaser.png",
                "caption": "Figure 1:S-Agent 2.0 is a spatial reasoning agent built on a general\ncoding agent. A command-line perception toolkit lets the agent close the\nevidence loop, acquiring scene evidence, remembering it in a persistent\nscene memory, and interpreting every reading in plain spatial language.\nS-Agent 2.0 delivers strong performance: it leads MMSI-Bench and ReVSI and\nstays ahead of the specialized agentic system SpatialClaw on every\nbenchmark and backbone we test.",
                "position": 241
            }
        ]
