        "header": "3Experiments",
        "images": [
            {
                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.28354/2610.28354v1/qualitative.png",
                "caption": "Figure 4:Qualitative analysis. Left: two items where SpatialClaw calls the\nright tools and gets the right perception, and still answers wrong, with\nS-Agent 2.0 correct on both (gemini-3.8-flash on both sides).\nTop right: S-Agent 2.0 cross-checking its own perception against the\nscene memory, dropping the wrong masks\nbefore grounding the observer and reading the answer. Bottom\nright: the two remaining grounding failure classes, a wrongly imagined viewpoint\nand a quantity read in the wrong sense. Zoom in for better\nreadability.",
                "position": 1666
            }
